# Unreal Engine generated folders
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/*/
!Build/Android/
Build/Android/*
!Build/Android/ManifestRequirementsAdditions.txt

# Plugin build output
Plugins/**/Binaries/
